---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Full-stack developer specializing in modern web technologies"
	pubDate={new Date('January 15 2025')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<h2>Hello, I'm Alex Chen</h2>
	<p>
		I'm a full-stack developer with a passion for creating beautiful, performant web experiences. 
		With over 5 years of experience in web development, I specialize in modern JavaScript frameworks, 
		cloud architecture, and user-centered design.
	</p>

	<h3>My Journey</h3>
	<p>
		My journey into web development began during my computer science studies, where I discovered the 
		perfect blend of creativity and technical challenge in building web applications. Since then, I've 
		worked with startups and established companies, helping them bring their digital visions to life.
	</p>

	<h3>What I Do</h3>
	<p>
		I specialize in:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Frontend Development</strong>: React, Vue, Astro, TypeScript, and modern CSS</li>
		<li><strong>Backend Development</strong>: Node.js, Python, RESTful APIs, and GraphQL</li>
		<li><strong>Cloud Services</strong>: AWS, Cloudflare Workers, serverless architectures</li>
		<li><strong>Performance Optimization</strong>: Web vitals, lazy loading, and caching strategies</li>
		<li><strong>DevOps</strong>: CI/CD pipelines, Docker, and infrastructure as code</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Recent Achievements</h3>
	<p>
		Some highlights from my recent work:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Led the migration of a monolithic application to microservices, improving deployment speed by 70%</li>
		<li>Optimized a high-traffic e-commerce site, achieving 95+ Lighthouse scores across all metrics</li>
		<li>Built a real-time collaboration platform handling 10,000+ concurrent users</li>
		<li>Open source contributor to several popular JavaScript libraries</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Beyond Code</h3>
	<p>
		When I'm not coding, you'll find me exploring new technologies, contributing to open source projects, 
		or sharing knowledge through technical blog posts. I believe in continuous learning and staying 
		current with the rapidly evolving web development landscape.
	</p>

	<h3>Let's Connect</h3>
	<p>
		I'm always interested in new challenges and opportunities to create impactful web experiences. 
		Whether you have a project in mind or just want to connect, feel free to reach out through my 
		social media channels or email me directly.
	</p>
</Layout>
